WEBVTT

00:00:06.784 --> 00:00:09.086
(sighs)

00:00:12.523 --> 00:00:14.859
(speaking Minionese)

00:00:16.694 --> 00:00:18.929
Ooh! Oh, excuse me.

00:00:18.963 --> 00:00:22.767
Uh, pardon me,
young... people?

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.903
Would you tell me
how to get to this address?

00:00:25.936 --> 00:00:29.774
Uh... uh, uh.
(speaking Minionese)

00:00:29.807 --> 00:00:32.143
I'm looking for a Mr. Gru.

00:00:32.177 --> 00:00:34.912
Gru... (speaks Minionese,
blows raspberry)

00:00:34.945 --> 00:00:36.347
-Yeah!
-Yeah!

00:00:36.381 --> 00:00:39.184
-(overlapping chatter,
blowing raspberries) -Ciao.

00:00:39.217 --> 00:00:42.520
Uh. Uh. (groans)

00:00:42.553 --> 00:00:44.054
(blows raspberry)

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:47.492
Idiots.

00:00:47.525 --> 00:00:50.261
(growling)

00:00:50.295 --> 00:00:52.297
No! Kyle! Stop!

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:54.632
-Ugh! Kyle, let go!
-(growling)

00:00:54.665 --> 00:00:56.934
(low growling)

00:00:56.967 --> 00:01:00.538
No! No!
You've got to be kidding me!

00:01:00.571 --> 00:01:02.207
Lucy, did you see...?

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.209
AGNES: He helps you
if you have nightmares.

00:01:04.242 --> 00:01:06.544
And he's really good
to snuggle with.

00:01:06.577 --> 00:01:08.045
Oh, no, no, no.
Agnes! Agnes!

00:01:08.078 --> 00:01:10.181
So... take good care of him.

00:01:10.215 --> 00:01:12.149
Thank you!
(laughs)

00:01:12.183 --> 00:01:13.851
Agnes, what are you doing?

00:01:13.884 --> 00:01:16.721
You... you sold your unicorn?

00:01:16.754 --> 00:01:20.525
Well, I just wanted to help,
since you don't have a job.

00:01:20.558 --> 00:01:23.160
I got two whole dollars
for it.

00:01:23.194 --> 00:01:25.996
-BOTH: Ah.
-(man clears his throat)

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:27.798
Uh, excuse me?

00:01:27.832 --> 00:01:29.467
Sorry, buddy,
the sale's over.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.869
Yes, but this will
only take a...

00:01:31.902 --> 00:01:34.004
Hey, eyebrows,
get off the lawn.

00:01:34.038 --> 00:01:35.806
-Ja, but...
-(sighs heavily)

00:01:35.840 --> 00:01:37.174
Hey, could you...?

00:01:37.208 --> 00:01:39.043
Oh, uh, of course.

00:01:39.076 --> 00:01:41.379
Now, as I was saying, I...

00:01:41.412 --> 00:01:42.813
Uh... Oh.

00:01:42.847 --> 00:01:45.716
-Good-bye!
-(indistinct yelling)

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:47.352
(explosion)

00:01:47.385 --> 00:01:48.986
(laughing)

00:01:49.019 --> 00:01:52.022
Listen, Agnes,
you don't need to worry.

00:01:52.056 --> 00:01:53.891
We're going to be fine.

00:01:53.924 --> 00:01:55.726
-For real?
-For real.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:58.095
Now, come on,
let's pack this stuff up.

00:01:58.128 --> 00:02:00.331
-MAN: Ow. Ow.
-Seriously?

00:02:00.365 --> 00:02:02.733
-Ow. Oh. -Buddy, you're not
getting the hint. -(growling)

00:02:02.767 --> 00:02:05.202
E-Excuse me, Mr. Gru...

00:02:05.236 --> 00:02:08.873
but I really must
have a word with you.

00:02:08.906 --> 00:02:10.608
How do you know my name?

00:02:10.641 --> 00:02:12.443
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:02:12.477 --> 00:02:14.111
-My name is Fritz.
-(growling, smacking)

00:02:14.144 --> 00:02:15.713
Ow. (whimpers)

00:02:15.746 --> 00:02:17.415
-(growling)
-Good puppy.

00:02:17.448 --> 00:02:21.218
And I am inquiring on behalf
of your twin brother, Dru.

00:02:21.252 --> 00:02:23.354
-(growling continues)
-He needs your help.

00:02:23.388 --> 00:02:25.089
What? Twin brother?

00:02:25.122 --> 00:02:27.358
-Twin brother?
-(speaking Minionese)

00:02:27.392 --> 00:02:31.128
Oh, ja. He would like to fly
you to Freedonia to meet him.

00:02:31.161 --> 00:02:34.031
Your father has recently
passed away, and...

00:02:34.064 --> 00:02:36.901
(laughing)
Okay, cuckoo.

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:38.469
-I'm sorry, but my dad died...
-(groaning)

00:02:38.503 --> 00:02:40.237
-when I was a baby.
-(groaning)

00:02:40.271 --> 00:02:42.373
And I don't have any brother.
You got the wrong guy.

00:02:42.407 --> 00:02:47.878
Really? Well, then,
how do you explain this?

00:02:47.912 --> 00:02:50.315
Uh, wha...?

00:02:50.348 --> 00:02:54.084
(humming "Garota de Ipanema")

00:02:54.118 --> 00:02:56.153
(laughs)
Bellissimo!

00:02:56.186 --> 00:02:58.823
(laughs)
Oh.

00:02:58.856 --> 00:03:01.759
-Oh, hello, Gru.
-Hi, Mom.

00:03:01.792 --> 00:03:05.463
It's important to keep active
in one's golden years.

00:03:05.496 --> 00:03:07.298
-Ah. Oh!
-(trilling)

00:03:07.332 --> 00:03:09.967
There you are,
you cutie, you.

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:11.569
Oh! (laughs)

00:03:11.602 --> 00:03:15.940
Uh, these are
my diving instructors--

00:03:15.973 --> 00:03:18.576
Vincenzo und Paolo.

00:03:18.609 --> 00:03:19.977
(growls playfully, laughs)

00:03:20.010 --> 00:03:21.912
Ciao, boys.

00:03:21.946 --> 00:03:24.749
(groans)
So, what do you want?

00:03:24.782 --> 00:03:27.818
Mom, do I have
a twin brother?

00:03:27.852 --> 00:03:29.253
(gasps)

00:03:29.286 --> 00:03:31.121
How did you find out?
Who told you?

00:03:31.155 --> 00:03:32.490
Wait. What?
It's true?!

00:03:32.523 --> 00:03:34.492
You never told me
I had a brother!

00:03:34.525 --> 00:03:36.927
And you told me that Dad died
of disappointment

00:03:36.961 --> 00:03:38.295
when I was born.

00:03:38.329 --> 00:03:41.799
Ja, ja. Uh, uh,
that was the agreement.

00:03:41.832 --> 00:03:44.535
Agreement?
What are you talking about?

00:03:44.569 --> 00:03:46.371
(sighs)

00:03:46.404 --> 00:03:50.941
Shortly after you
and your brother were born,

00:03:50.975 --> 00:03:53.043
your father and I divorced.

00:03:53.077 --> 00:03:56.681
We each took one son
to raise on our own,

00:03:56.714 --> 00:03:59.984
and promised never
to see each other again.

00:04:01.819 --> 00:04:03.721
Obviously... (laughing)

00:04:03.754 --> 00:04:05.656
...I got second pick.

00:04:08.493 --> 00:04:11.696
I have a brother.

00:04:11.729 --> 00:04:14.365
* Take me

00:04:14.399 --> 00:04:16.401
* Far away

00:04:16.434 --> 00:04:18.302
-* Anywhere...
-Hey, girls!

00:04:18.335 --> 00:04:20.237
How are things
in Row B, huh?

00:04:20.270 --> 00:04:22.740
I put together some fun
activities for the trip!

00:04:22.773 --> 00:04:25.643
Who is up
for some gin rummy?

00:04:25.676 --> 00:04:27.311
-Yeah.
-* Take me

00:04:27.344 --> 00:04:29.380
-Um... we're good.
-* Far away

00:04:29.414 --> 00:04:31.916
-* Anywhere...
-Oh. Okay.

00:04:31.949 --> 00:04:33.918
I'll just sit here
and play solitaire.

00:04:33.951 --> 00:04:36.220
I hope I win.

00:04:36.253 --> 00:04:39.356
-(sighs) -I wonder
what Dru will be like. Ooh.

00:04:39.390 --> 00:04:41.158
Maybe we'll have
the twin thing

00:04:41.191 --> 00:04:44.228
when you can read
each other's minds, no?

00:04:44.261 --> 00:04:45.663
How cool would that be?

00:04:45.696 --> 00:04:47.998
Um, super cool!
(laughs)

00:04:48.032 --> 00:04:50.200
* Let's do everything
till the summer's done *

00:04:50.234 --> 00:04:53.538
* It's the greatest time
for a soda yum... *

00:04:53.571 --> 00:04:56.607
-(squealing and snorting)
-(laughing)

00:04:56.641 --> 00:04:58.409
(sighs)
Ooh!

00:04:58.443 --> 00:05:00.110
(groaning)

00:05:00.144 --> 00:05:02.346
(laughing)

00:05:02.379 --> 00:05:04.782
-Ooh.
-(whooping)

00:05:04.815 --> 00:05:09.019
EDITH AND AGNES: Freedonia!
Freedonia! Freedonia!

00:05:09.053 --> 00:05:10.921
-(snorting)
-Hi, piggy, piggy!

00:05:10.955 --> 00:05:12.557
-(snorts)
-(gasps) Whoa!

00:05:12.590 --> 00:05:14.391
Look at that house!

00:05:14.425 --> 00:05:16.627
It's like a castle!

00:05:16.661 --> 00:05:20.064
* I can't wait
to meet my brother! *

00:05:20.097 --> 00:05:22.533
-Uh, what's with all the pigs?
-(pigs snorting)

00:05:22.567 --> 00:05:25.202
This is the family business.

00:05:25.235 --> 00:05:28.238
The largest pig farm
in the whole of Freedonia.

00:05:28.272 --> 00:05:29.640
(gasps)

00:05:29.674 --> 00:05:31.609
Okay, nice pig.

00:05:31.642 --> 00:05:34.812
(groans)
No! That's my private part!

00:05:34.845 --> 00:05:37.147
(pig snorting,
Gru yelling)

00:05:37.181 --> 00:05:39.650
This pig has issues!

00:05:39.684 --> 00:05:41.752
-Please, come in.
-(low growling)

00:05:41.786 --> 00:05:43.588
-Wha...? Yeah! (laughs)
-(gasping)

00:05:43.621 --> 00:05:45.723
(laughter)

00:05:45.756 --> 00:05:48.125
(yelling)

00:05:48.158 --> 00:05:49.794
-(sighs)
-(pig snorting)

00:05:49.827 --> 00:05:51.328
(gasps)

00:05:51.361 --> 00:05:53.998
Oh, this is amazing.

00:05:54.031 --> 00:05:56.501
Oh, it's like
the Sistine Chapel!

00:05:56.534 --> 00:05:58.002
But with pigs.

00:05:58.035 --> 00:06:02.439
(loud cackling)

00:06:02.473 --> 00:06:08.178
My brother...!

00:06:10.548 --> 00:06:12.517
BOTH:
My brother!

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:15.119
-Gru!
-Dru!

00:06:15.152 --> 00:06:21.091
(laughing)

00:06:21.125 --> 00:06:22.527
-Oh.
-(laughing)

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:23.961
-(groans)
-Brother!

00:06:23.994 --> 00:06:26.831
-I am hugging you!
-(rhythmic groaning)

00:06:26.864 --> 00:06:29.333
-(laughing): I'm so happy!
-Mm, mm.

00:06:29.366 --> 00:06:33.270
After all of these years,
finally I'm meeting you!

00:06:33.303 --> 00:06:35.305
Yu... yup.
All right, good.

00:06:35.339 --> 00:06:37.542
Oh, look at that.

00:06:37.575 --> 00:06:39.944
-Ooh! -You must be
the beautiful wife.

00:06:39.977 --> 00:06:41.679
Beautiful? Oh.

00:06:41.712 --> 00:06:43.981
(laughing):
Stop it. Sweet talker.

00:06:44.014 --> 00:06:45.650
How is my brother
finding a wife

00:06:45.683 --> 00:06:47.985
like you
when he is so bald? (laughing)

00:06:48.018 --> 00:06:49.654
-(groaning)
-I'm joking.

00:06:49.687 --> 00:06:51.188
(laughter)

00:06:51.221 --> 00:06:55.292
(whooping)
These must be my * nieces!

00:06:55.325 --> 00:06:56.794
(gasps):
You're Agnes!

00:06:56.827 --> 00:06:59.363
-You are small with big eyes.
-(laughs)

00:06:59.396 --> 00:07:01.365
And it makes me want
to put you into my pocket.

00:07:01.398 --> 00:07:03.000
-Ooh, ooh, ooh.
-You can't do that!

00:07:03.033 --> 00:07:04.969
I'm too big.

00:07:05.002 --> 00:07:06.403
Oh. (laughs) Edith!

00:07:06.436 --> 00:07:09.173
I can tell that you are
a little mischievous.

00:07:09.206 --> 00:07:12.209
-(laughing) -We're gonna have
to make a little trouble later.

00:07:12.242 --> 00:07:14.712
-Well, I already have! (laughs)
-(kicking) -FRITZ: Ow!

00:07:14.745 --> 00:07:16.313
-Ow! Ow! -(kicking)
-(laughter)

00:07:16.346 --> 00:07:19.383
Please... stop.
Why are you doing that? Ow!

00:07:19.416 --> 00:07:22.987
-Ow. -Fist bump
for mischievous behavior.

00:07:23.020 --> 00:07:26.056
And Margo.
Oh, you are so mature.

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:28.893
I'm guessing, what, mm, 15?

00:07:28.926 --> 00:07:30.561
(laughing):
15?

00:07:30.595 --> 00:07:34.599
She's 12. She looks 12,
and will always be 12.

00:07:34.632 --> 00:07:37.034
So, Dru,
this place is amazing.

00:07:37.067 --> 00:07:39.069
I mean, you just walk through
the doors, and you're, like...

00:07:39.103 --> 00:07:41.105
(makes silly noise, laughs)

00:07:41.138 --> 00:07:43.540
Oh, it's nice, I guess, sure.

00:07:43.574 --> 00:07:45.910
I'm not really into things.

